  "as_of_notes": "Idaho publishes monthly voter registration snapshots labeled by year-month; the file 202606_CountyTotals.csv represents totals as of June 1, 2026 (the start of the month). This is the most recent monthly dataset available as of the research date (2026-06-14); no July 2026 file exists yet. The VoteIdaho dashboard page text read 'Last updated May 1, 2026' at time of fetch, but the underlying archive already contained the June (202606) dataset, which is used here as the latest.",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "Source data: https://archive.voteidaho.gov/data/voter-registrations/202606_CountyTotals.csv (the CSV backing the official VoteIdaho.gov voter registration dashboard, formerly hosted on sos.idaho.gov). All 44 Idaho counties present. Verified: each county party breakdown sums to its county total; county totals sum to the statewide grand total (1,029,200); statewide figures also cross-check exactly against the official Congressional district rollup (202606_CongressionalTotals.csv). Party columns: Republican, Democratic, Unaffiliated, Constitution, Libertarian. All values are integers."
}